# Copy to ui/.env.local for local dev, and set the same two in Vercel's
# project Environment Variables for production.
#
# Both are PUBLIC — they're baked into the browser bundle. That's safe ONLY
# because Row Level Security is enabled on the table (see supabase/schema.sql).
